  "bodyHash": "263c47ad6111a4bc",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\">概述</span><br>為 272 個模組及原版遊戲新增發光礦石材質，沒有任何其他資源包能達到如此高的支援數量！更新會持續加入更多模組支援，歡迎提出請求 :)</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\">我的願景</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>我計畫盡可能地支援更多模組，讓你能在絕大多數的整合包中使用。我已將此資源包設計為與不同模組版本高度相容。</p>\n<p>如果你發現已支援模組中的某些礦石沒有發光或使用了過時的材質，請留言告知該模組名稱、模組載入器（Mod Loader）以及你使用的 Minecraft 版本。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Glowing Emissive Ores Definitive Edition：<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p>請查看此資源包的模組版本。它經過最佳化，僅載入你所安裝模組所需的資源，大幅縮短讀取時間。此外，它還提供遊戲內設定檔，可調整亮度或停用個別礦石，且無需任何第三方發光模組。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glowing-emissive-ores-definitive-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glowing-emissive-ores-definitive-edition</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚠️ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>需求：</strong></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你可以使用我網站上的篩選工具，快速找出適合你整合包模組載入器與 Minecraft 版本的需求選項：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeftesthawk.github.io%252fglowing-emissive-ores%252frequirements-filter%252f%253fvariant%253dresource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deftesthawk.github.io/glowing-emissive-ores/requirements-filter/</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">NeoForge 需求：</span></h3>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h3>選項 1（1.21 與 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector&nbsp;</a>- （Continuity 在 NeoForge 上運作所需）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium&nbsp;</a>（NeoForge 版本，1.21.1+）或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 2（1.20.3 至 1.21.11）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Fusion&nbsp;</a>- （需置於 GEO 之前載入）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Forge 需求：</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 1（1.16.5 至 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta Emissive Textures (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 2（1.18.2 或 1.19.2）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectedness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connectedness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rubidium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rubidium</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 3（1.20.1、1.21 或 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector&nbsp;</a>- （Continuity 在 Forge 上運作所需）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 4（1.12 至 1.12.2 + 1.14 至 1.21.11）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Fusion&nbsp;</a>- （需置於 GEO 之前載入）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 5（不建議使用）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Fabric/Quilt 需求：</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h3>選項 1（1.18.2 至 26.2）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity&nbsp;</a>&ndash; （僅支援 1.18.2 及以上版本的發光材質）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium&nbsp;</a>- （非必需，但強烈推薦）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium&nbsp;</a>- （僅在使用低於 0.6 版本的 Sodium 時需要）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;已知低於 0.6 版本的 Sodium 與 Continuity 搭配使用時會產生 Z-fighting（材質閃爍）問題。</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 2（1.16.5 至 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta Emissive Textures (Fabric)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 3（1.18 至 1.21.11）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Fusion&nbsp;</a>- （需置於 GEO 之前載入）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>選項 4（不建議使用）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optifabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFabric</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🛠️ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>協助：</strong></span></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你可以在我的網站上找到安裝說明與疑難排解協助：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeftesthawk.github.io%252fglowing-emissive-ores%252fhelp%252f%253fvariant%253dresource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deftesthawk.github.io/glowing-emissive-ores/help/</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">✅ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>支援的模組：</strong></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">你可以在我的網站上瀏覽並搜尋完整的支援模組列表：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeftesthawk.github.io%252fglowing-emissive-ores%252fsupported%252f%253fvariant%253dresource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deftesthawk.github.io/glowing-emissive-ores/supported/</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#b96ad9\">請考慮贊助我的&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdeftesthawk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi</a>，我投入了大量時間建立與更新此資源包。</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br>第三方資源包支援：</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>以下列出我為第三方資源包額外開發的支援資源包：</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Excalibur</span> 可於官方 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qYZ9Pen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur Discord</a> 伺服器的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">MODS</span> / <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">royal-library</span> 頻道中找到</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-industrial-revolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - 工業革命翻新版</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-pixel-perfection-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - 像素完美經典版</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-stay-true\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - 忠實原貌</a></p>\n</div>",
